{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09479","headline":"宝观主白鸜鹆歌 · 韦应物","name":"宝观主白鸜鹆歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸜鹆鸜鹆，衆皆如漆，尔独如玉。\n鸜之鹆之，衆皆蓬蒿下。\n尔自三山来，三山处子下人间。\n绰约不妆冰雪颜，仙鸟随飞来掌上。\n来掌上，时拂拭。\n人心鸟意自无猜，玉指霜毛本同色。\n有时一去凌苍苍，朝游汗漫暮玉堂。\n巫峡雨中飞暂湿，杏花林里过来香。\n日夕依仁全羽翼，空欲衔环非报德。\n岂不及阿母之家青鸟儿，汉宫来往传消息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}